WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:17.651
The ground was moving, and Aladdin started to run for his life!

2
00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:24.136
"Stay!" shouted Magrib and he grabbed Aladdin by the collar of his new jacket.

3
00:00:25.116 --> 00:00:29.500
Then Magrib raised his hand and struck the boy across the face.

4
00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:34.406
Aladdin's cap went flying, and his teeth rattled in his head.

5
00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:39.109
He fell to the ground, weeping with pain and fear.

6
00:00:39.129 --> 00:00:41.871
"Uncle!" he cried.

7
00:00:41.891 --> 00:00:42.971
"What did I do?

8
00:00:43.531 --> 00:00:44.572
Why did you strike me?"

9
00:00:44.592 --> 00:00:50.355
"I'm sorry, but I was angered by your fear," said Magrib.

10
00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:54.258
"I am your uncle, and you must always obey me.

11
00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:56.499
You must not be afraid.

12
00:00:56.959 --> 00:00:58.320
You must not run away."

13
00:00:59.445 --> 00:01:04.309
Magrib set Aladdin's cap back on his head and brushed the dust from his clothes.

14
00:01:04.329 --> 00:01:08.313
"I will try to be brave, Uncle," said Aladdin.

15
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:11.416
"Be calm, my boy," said Magrib.

16
00:01:11.436 --> 00:01:14.960
"Come and see how my magic has opened the earth."

17
00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:18.143
"Magic?" breathed Aladdin.

18
00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:22.947
Magrib stretched out his arm and pointed with his finger.

19
00:01:23.948 --> 00:01:29.593
Where the earth had split, Aladdin saw a thick piece of marble with a big brass ring on

20
00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:32.115
top. "What is this?"

21
00:01:32.755 --> 00:01:33.556
Aladdin asked.

22
00:01:33.576 --> 00:01:38.120
"It is a special door," answered the magician.

23
00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.861
"Listen closely.

24
00:01:40.221 --> 00:01:44.305
Do exactly as I say and you will be mightier and richer than any king."

25
00:01:44.325 --> 00:01:46.526
"Tell me what to do!"

26
00:01:46.827 --> 00:01:47.587
cried Aladdin.

27
00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.229
"I will obey every word!"

28
00:01:49.249 --> 00:01:54.201
"Under this marble door is a treasure," said Magrib.

29
00:01:54.221 --> 00:01:56.702
"It is for you alone.

30
00:01:57.323 --> 00:01:58.864
No one but you may claim it."

31
00:01:58.884 --> 00:02:01.286
"How do I get to the treasure?"

32
00:02:01.686 --> 00:02:02.386
asked Aladdin.

33
00:02:02.406 --> 00:02:07.230
"Grab the brass ring and lift the stone," said the magician.

34
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.172
"What?" gasped Aladdin.

35
00:02:10.712 --> 00:02:12.133
He looked down at the marble.

36
00:02:12.153 --> 00:02:14.415
"Oh, Uncle," he said.

37
00:02:14.435 --> 00:02:17.057
"It is huge—it must be so heavy.

38
00:02:18.157 --> 00:02:20.139
I am not strong enough to lift it by myself.

39
00:02:20.519 --> 00:02:21.440
You must help me!"

40
00:02:22.452 --> 00:02:24.513
"I cannot help you," said Magrib.

41
00:02:25.633 --> 00:02:27.754
"No one but you has the power to lift it.

42
00:02:28.494 --> 00:02:30.175
No one but you may touch it!"

43
00:02:30.195 --> 00:02:32.516
"But, Uncle!"

44
00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:33.677
cried Aladdin.

45
00:02:33.697 --> 00:02:38.058
"Reach out your hand, grab the ring, and pull," ordered Magrib.

46
00:02:38.879 --> 00:02:41.680
"Then say your name and command the stone to rise.

47
00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:43.701
It will obey you.

48
00:02:44.181 --> 00:02:45.841
I promise it will not be heavy."

49
00:02:45.861 --> 00:02:48.122
"But how can that be?"

50
00:02:48.142 --> 00:02:52.988
"Open the door," said Magrib.

51
00:02:53.008 --> 00:02:55.430
Unsure, the boy looked down at the marble.

52
00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:58.572
"I cannot do it," he said to himself.

53
00:02:58.592 --> 00:03:01.174
"Open the door!"

54
00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:02.394
shouted Magrib.

55
00:03:04.176 --> 00:03:06.957
Aladdin repeated the command to himself softly.

56
00:03:06.978 --> 00:03:10.460
"My name is Aladdin," he said.

57
00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.461
"I command you to rise."

58
00:03:13.342 --> 00:03:15.023
Then he repeated it louder.

59
00:03:15.043 --> 00:03:17.164
"My name is Aladdin.

60
00:03:17.585 --> 00:03:18.985
I command you to rise."

61
00:03:19.005 --> 00:03:23.780
"Do it, boy," hissed Magrib.

62
00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:27.043
Aladdin rubbed his hands together and took a deep breath.

63
00:03:28.184 --> 00:03:32.067
He reached out his hand, grabbed the brass ring, and pulled.

64
00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:34.990
"My name is Aladdin!"

65
00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:35.990
he shouted.

66
00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.612
"I command you to rise!"

67
00:03:38.733 --> 00:03:41.755
As the boy pulled, the stone rose.

68
00:03:42.596 --> 00:03:44.297
Aladdin was amazed.

69
00:03:45.498 --> 00:03:49.361
Within moments, he had removed the door and tossed it aside!

70
00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:54.686
He now saw a deep, dark hole where the marble had been.

71
00:03:56.828 --> 00:03:59.611
Magrib leaned over and looked into the opening.

72
00:04:00.731 --> 00:04:06.076
They could both see a steep stone stairway disappearing down into the shadows.

73
00:04:07.357 --> 00:04:08.919
Aladdin looked up at Magrib.

74
00:04:08.939 --> 00:04:10.240
"Where is the treasure?"

75
00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.061
he asked.

76
00:04:11.081 --> 00:04:14.884
"It is down there," said the magician.

77
00:04:14.904 --> 00:04:16.285
"Let's go!"

78
00:04:16.686 --> 00:04:17.526
shouted Aladdin.

79
00:04:17.546 --> 00:04:19.188
"Let's go and get it right now!"

80
00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:25.240
"No one can enter the enchanted treasury but you," said Magrib.

81
00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:26.806
"You must go alone."
